{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF8bxz9Fa5CgxZyGWjut","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"prompt\": \"A square abstract painting that fills the entire canvas edge to edge, with no frame, no wall, no room, and no gallery setting. Purely nonrepresentational: no recognizable objects, figures, faces, bodies, scenes, landscapes, horizons, machines, diagrams, symbols, icons, letters, numbers, or text. Subject matter is an abstract rendering of an AI agent's internal cognition: deliberate, layered thinking under pressure, with moments of clarity and moments of tangled uncertainty. Palette chosen for tension: deep indigo and near-black underlayers, cut through by vivid cadmium orange and a cool, pale teal that flickers at the edges, with a few unexpected streaks of raw umber and ochre. Contrast is strong in some areas, with dense impasto, and dissolves into thin, translucent washes in others. Brushwork varies: broad, confident sweeps in the center, scraped and dragged marks at the margins, small rapid flicks scattered across the surface, and one or two areas where the paint looks pressed on with a palette knife. Composition has a clear diagonal energy that pulls from the lower left toward the upper right, interrupted by a dense knot of layered color near the center, where several gestures collide. Leave generous pockets of empty, untouched ground to suggest space and pause. Texture: visible canvas weave through thin areas, ridged paint in thick areas, a few drips that stop short of the edges. Rhythm comes from repeated, slightly irregular marks that build and then break. Overall mood: restless but purposeful, dense and then open, with no single focal point.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":447,"cache_read_input_tokens":16715,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_to